### Sample requests (VS Code "REST Client" extension by Huachao Mao)
### Click "Send Request" above each request. Run requests top to bottom.

@host = http://localhost:3000
@tenant = tenant-a

### Health
GET {{host}}/health

### 1. Create message (copy the returned id into @messageId below)
POST {{host}}/api/v1/messages
Content-Type: application/json
x-tenant-id: {{tenant}}

{
  "tenantId": "tenant-a",
  "conversationId": "conv-100",
  "to": "+919876543210",
  "text": "Your order has shipped"
}

### Paste the message id here
@messageId = msg_REPLACE_ME

### 2. Get message
GET {{host}}/api/v1/messages/{{messageId}}
x-tenant-id: {{tenant}}

### 3. Tenant isolation: other tenant gets 404
GET {{host}}/api/v1/messages/{{messageId}}
x-tenant-id: tenant-b

### 4. List conversation (page 1)
GET {{host}}/api/v1/conversations/conv-100/messages?limit=2
x-tenant-id: {{tenant}}

### 5. List conversation (next page: paste nextCursor)
GET {{host}}/api/v1/conversations/conv-100/messages?limit=2&cursor=PASTE_CURSOR
x-tenant-id: {{tenant}}

### 6. Webhook: DELIVERED (APPLIED)
POST {{host}}/api/v1/webhooks/provider
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "eventId": "evt-001",
  "messageId": "{{messageId}}",
  "status": "DELIVERED",
  "occurredAt": "2026-10-16T08:30:00.000Z"
}

### 7. Webhook: same eventId again (duplicate: true, no second effect)
POST {{host}}/api/v1/webhooks/provider
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "eventId": "evt-001",
  "messageId": "{{messageId}}",
  "status": "DELIVERED",
  "occurredAt": "2026-10-16T08:30:00.000Z"
}

### 8. Webhook: READ (APPLIED)
POST {{host}}/api/v1/webhooks/provider
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "eventId": "evt-002",
  "messageId": "{{messageId}}",
  "status": "READ",
  "occurredAt": "2026-10-16T08:31:00.000Z"
}

### 9. Webhook: out-of-order late SENT (IGNORED_STALE, status stays READ)
POST {{host}}/api/v1/webhooks/provider
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "eventId": "evt-003",
  "messageId": "{{messageId}}",
  "status": "SENT",
  "occurredAt": "2026-10-16T08:29:00.000Z"
}

### 10. Webhook: unknown message (404)
POST {{host}}/api/v1/webhooks/provider
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "eventId": "evt-004",
  "messageId": "msg_does-not-exist",
  "status": "SENT",
  "occurredAt": "2026-10-16T08:30:00.000Z"
}

### 11. Webhook: invalid status (400)
POST {{host}}/api/v1/webhooks/provider
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "eventId": "evt-005",
  "messageId": "{{messageId}}",
  "status": "BANANA",
  "occurredAt": "2026-10-16T08:30:00.000Z"
}

### 12. Create message: invalid payload (400)
POST {{host}}/api/v1/messages
Content-Type: application/json
x-tenant-id: {{tenant}}

{ "tenantId": "tenant-a" }

### 13. Create message: tenant mismatch (403)
POST {{host}}/api/v1/messages
Content-Type: application/json
x-tenant-id: tenant-a

{
  "tenantId": "tenant-b",
  "conversationId": "conv-100",
  "to": "+919876543210",
  "text": "hi"
}

### 14. Missing tenant header (401)
GET {{host}}/api/v1/messages/{{messageId}}
